          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the movements of two bright points in the sky. The second point moves around the first, which follows a straight trajectory: this observation case is classified as \"D1\" (unexplained).",
          "translation_text_sha256": "9468eb3a54262e2f6f665f074fd4da26fbfb6caf4f6e74902566d02706cf7fa2"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
